  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "What connects the layers",
      "items": [
        "%AI.System.Configure(\"telemetry:context\") parents the Rust spans on the app's span",
        "%AI.Tool.CurrentTraceparent() hands the execute_tool span to the tool body",
        "Messages carry Traceparent so bs, bp and bo nest under the tool"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Who exports spans",
      "items": [
        "Demo app: the chat turn root span (Python OTel SDK)",
        "Rust core in irisllm.so: invoke_agent, chat, execute_tool",
        "Interop production: bs, bp, bo spans via %Trace",
        "All three post OTLP to one collector; only the collector talks to Langfuse",
        "iris-mcp-server shares the same exporter code (MR !2) but is not in this demo"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "The patch (ai-core, not yet in a build)",
      "items": [
        "MR !1: OTel GenAI telemetry spec",
        "MR !2: invoke_agent / execute_tool spans, traceparent handoff",
        "Issue #1: ChatIris dropped token usage",
        "irisllm.so, %AI classes and iris_llm wheel all from 7440647"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Worked around, not fixed",
      "items": [
        "Nested $ZF corrupts the outer frame (kernel CL 9598334 pending)",
        "So the tool runs the interop call in a worker job, passing only the traceparent"
      ]
    }
  ]
